# Theme for landau phase diagrams.
#
# Every plot function in landau.plot applies these keys for the duration of its
# call (landau.plot.style.theme), whatever the caller's rcParams hold; every
# other rcParam is the caller's. Load the sheet globally to also cover axes and
# figures created outside the plot calls, and savefig:
#
#     import matplotlib.pyplot as plt
#     plt.style.use("landau.plot.landau")

lines.linewidth: 2.0

axes.titlesize: medium
xtick.labelsize: small
ytick.labelsize: small
legend.fontsize: small
legend.frameon: False

figure.figsize: 6.0, 4.5
savefig.dpi: 150
savefig.bbox: tight
